# Pytest

- TDD: failing test before production code.
- `@pytest.mark.django_db` (or module `pytestmark`) when touching the database.
- Factory Boy for models once factories exist; fixtures in `conftest.py`.
- Test behavior and HTTP/status/side effects, not Django internals.
- Run with `.venv/bin/pytest`. Settings module is `core.settings.test`.

See skill: `pytest-django-patterns`.
